given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Preparation and characterization of methyl substituted 2,2&#x02032;-dipyridyl diselenides and -ditellurides: X-ray structure of 6,6&#x02032;-dimethyl-2,2&#x02032;-dipyridyl diselenide</article-title><source><italic>Phosphorus, Sulfur and Silicon and the Related Elements</italic></source><year>2002</year><volume>177</volume><issue>11</issue><fpage>2579</fpage><lpage>2587</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B20"><label>20</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Mugesh</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Singh</surname><given-names>HB</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Heteroatom-directed aromatic lithiation: a versatile route to the synthesis of organochalcogen (Se, Te) compounds</article-title><source><italic>Accounts of Chemical Research</italic></source><year>2002</year><volume>35</volume><issue>4</issue><fpage>226</fpage><lpage>236</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11955051</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B21"><label>21</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Marsais</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Queguiner</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Review on the metallation of <italic>&#x003c0;</italic> -deficient heteroaromatic compounds: regioselective ortho-lithiation of 3-fluoropyridine: directing effects and application to synthesis of 2,3- or 3,4-disubstituted pyridines</article-title><source><italic>Tetrahedron</italic></source><year>1983</year><volume>39</volume><issue>12</issue><fpage>2009</fpage><lpage>2021</lpage></citation></ref></ref-list></back><floats-wrap><fig position="float" id="F1"><label>Scheme 1</label><graphic xlink:href="BCA2007-69263.001" alt-version="no" position="float" xlink:type="simple" mimetype="image"/></fig><fig position="float" id="F2"><label>Scheme 2</label><graphic xlink:href="BCA2007-69263.002" alt-version="no" position="float" xlink:type="simple" mimetype="image"/></fig><fig position="float" id="F3"><label>Scheme 3</label><graphic xlink:href="BCA2007-69263.003" alt-version="no" position="float" xlink:type="simple" mimetype="image"/></fig><fig position="float" id="F4"><label>Scheme 4</label><caption><p>Protocol for regioselective synthesis of <italic>bis</italic>(2-halo-3-pyridyl) dichalcogenides.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="BCA2007-69263.004" alt-version="no" position="float" xlink:type="simple" mimetype="image"/></fig><fig position="float" id="F5"><label>Scheme 5</label><caption><p>Oxidation of pyridine thiols to disulfides.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="BCA2007-69263.005" alt-version="no" position="float" xlink:type="simple" mimetype="image"/></fig><fig position="float" id="F6"><label>Figure 1</label><caption><p>(a) [<sup>1</sup>H&#x02212;<sup>1</sup>H] COSY (HOMCOR-2D) spectrum of <italic>bis</italic>(2-chloro-3-pyridyl) diselenide, (b) [<sup>1</sup>H&#x02212;<sup>13</sup>C] COSY (HETCOR-2D) spectrum of <italic>bis</italic>(2-chloro-3-pyridyl) diselenide.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="BCA2007-69263.006" alt-version="no" position="float" xlink:type="simple" mimetype="image"/></fig><fig position="float" id="F7"><label>Figure 2</label><caption><p>A perspective view of the structure of <italic>bis</italic>(2-chloro-3-pyridyl) diselenide.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="BCA2007-69263.007" alt-version="no" position="float" xlink:type="simple" mimetype="image"/></fig><fig position="float" id="F8"><label>Figure 3</label><caption><p>A perspective view of the structure of <italic>bis</italic>(2-chloro-3-pyridyl) ditelluride.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="BCA2007-69263.008" alt-version="no" position="float" xlink:type="simple" mimetype="image"/></fig><table-wrap position="float" id="T1"><label>Table 1</label><caption><p>Physical properties and analytical data of various 2-halo-3-pyridyl chalcogen compounds.</p></caption><